}

### Skip a pending stage
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/batches/91fc4cd7-79a8-4d4b-9bd7-8ff4c66c21fa/stages/492e4194-749d-42e2-bf41-3f59e4e132bd/skip
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

