Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### The image of a crumb photo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bake-records/b77babe6-9f9b-4dce-b844-699603e9c3c3/photos/72fc35b7-87e1-4b1b-93bf-330a2a3a0ff8
